                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (U, T)
            can be defined directly using inference rules instead of a judgmental equality, which say that identities
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
