          %h2#InCategoricalSemantics In categorical semantics
          %p
            Let
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi 𝒞
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{C}
            be a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/locally+cartesian+closed+model+category"} locally cartesian closed model category
            in which all objects are cofibrant.
          %p
            By the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/categorical+semantics"} categorical semantics
            of
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+type+theory"} homotopy type theory
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dependent+type"} dependent type
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
